2	//!
3	//! The `bivvy snapshot` command manages named snapshots for change check baselines.
4	//!
5	//! Usage:
6	//!   bivvy snapshot <slug>                    # Capture snapshot for all change checks
7	//!   bivvy snapshot <slug> --step <name>      # Capture for a specific step
8	//!   bivvy snapshot <slug> --workflow <name>  # Capture for a specific workflow
9	//!   bivvy snapshot list                      # List all named snapshots
